<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Create a virtual space: a multiplayer 8-bit office linked to a channel where up to 20 people walk around a tile map, sit at tables and chat. The command posts an invite card in the channel so anyone eligible can join."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_code}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Syntax")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/space [#channel] [name] [ttl=2h]")}</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tag}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Parameters")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <code>#channel</code> {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "— Target channel for the invite card (defaults to the active channel)."
  )}
  <br /><code>name</code> {dgettext("help_commands", "— Optional space name shown on the card.")}
  <br /><code>ttl=</code> {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "— Optional lifetime, e.g. ttl=4h. Default 2h, maximum 8h."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_commands", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_commands", "Running")} <code>{dgettext("help_commands", "/space")}</code>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "creates the space and publishes an invite card in the channel. Clicking the card (or opening the /space/<token> link) drops your avatar into the map. The space expires when its lifetime ends, or earlier if the creator closes it. If nobody joins within 5 minutes, it expires automatically."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Rules & Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_commands", "You must be registered and identified (via")} <code>{dgettext("help_commands", "/ns identify")}</code>).
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "The command only works from a channel, not from PMs or the Status window."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "You need permission to post in the target channel.")}</li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_commands", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-virtual-spaces">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Virtual Spaces")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
